        <div class="accordion-content" data-tab-content>
<p>UT Health San Antonio’s Web Initiatives team designs, builds, and supports websites, web apps, and SharePoint environments that align user needs with institutional goals and accessibility standards. We provide guidance for internal and external developers, along with options for WordPress hosting and content management.</p>
<p><a class="arrow">Learn more about Web Initiatives</a></p>
</p>
        </div>
