        <div class="accordion-content" data-tab-content>
          <p>This service provides leadership and support for technology-driven process improvements across the Health Science Center. We help with project management, development, training, and testing while guiding change management for lasting success.</p>
<p><a class="arrow">Learn more about PPMD</a></p>
</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="accordion-item" data-accordion-item>
        <a href="#" class="accordion-title"><strong>Business Systems Services</strong></a>
        <div class="accordion-content" data-tab-content>
<p>Business Systems Services provides maintenance of day-to-day operations of enterprise administrative systems which serve faculty, students, and staff. The services and expertise include Database Administration, Enterprise System Maintenance and Production Support, Application Access Management, Application Security Management, Accounts Management, Reporting and Analytics, and Integration Services.</p>
<p><a class="arrow">Visit the BSS page</a></p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="accordion-item" data-accordion-item>
        <a href="#" class="accordion-title"><strong>Business Applications</strong></a>
        <div class="accordion-content" data-tab-content>
<p>Access the tools and applications that keep our university running. This page connects faculty and staff to essential systems for managing business operations, communication, and daily workflows.</p>
<p><a class="external">View all applications</a></p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="accordion-item" data-accordion-item>
        <a href="#" class="accordion-title"><strong>Salesforce (CRM)</strong></a>
        <div class="accordion-content" data-tab-content>
<p>Salesforce (CRM) services support key institutional groups across UT Health San Antonio by providing dedicated assistance for core CRM functionality, user access, support tickets, and enhancement requests. Whether users are part of Advancement & Alumni Engagement (AAE), the Strong Star Training Initiative (SSTI), or working within the broader Institutional Salesforce or Marketing Cloud environments, each area receives tailored support to manage new user licenses, troubleshoot issues, and request improvements. These services ensure that every Salesforce department—from core CRM operations to targeted engagement programs—has the technical guidance, maintenance, and customization needed to operate smoothly and meet evolving business and communication goals.</p>
<p><a class="external">View all CRM tools</a></p>
        </div>
      </li>
<li class="accordion-item" data-accordion-item>
        <a href="#" class="accordion-title"><strong>Access Control Executive (PeopleSoft)</strong></a>
        <div class="accordion-content" data-tab-content>
<p>The ACE oversees departmental access to key administrative business systems such as PeopleSoft, the Document Review System (DRS), Data Warehouse, and eShipGlobal—all of which contain sensitive data vital to UT Health San Antonio operations.</p>
<p><a class="external">View all ACE tools</a></p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="accordion-item" data-accordion-item>
        <a href="#" class="accordion-title"><strong>UT Print</strong></a>
        <div class="accordion-content" data-tab-content>
          <p>UT Print offers printing, copying, and promotional item services for the UT Health San Antonio community. From offset printing and in-house bindery to shared copier solutions, we handle everything from business cards to full-color publications. We also provide branded apparel and promotional items, available in both in-stock and custom options.</p>
<p><a class="arrow">All UT Print Services</a></p>
</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="accordion-item" data-accordion-item>
        <a href="#" class="accordion-title"><strong>AI Tools</strong></a>
        <div class="accordion-content" data-tab-content>
          <p>UT Health San Antonio is beginning to integrate AI technologies to enhance productivity and learning. From the Oracle HR Buddy Bot on UT Health Learns to Microsoft 365 Copilot, these tools are designed to simplify tasks, improve access to information, and support our community in new ways.</p>
            <p><a class="external">Microsoft Copilot</a></p>
            <p><a class="external">ChatGPT</a></p>
				<p><a class="external">Oracle HR Buddy Bot</a></p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="accordion-item" data-accordion-item>
        <a href="#" class="accordion-title"><strong>Audiovisual Support</strong></a>
        <div class="accordion-content" data-tab-content>
        <p>Audiovisual Support provides setup, maintenance, and troubleshooting for technology used in classrooms, conference rooms, and event spaces across UT Health San Antonio. The IMS team assists with equipment such as projectors, displays, microphones, and video conferencing systems to ensure clear communication and smooth presentations. Whether for teaching, meetings, or special events, we help create reliable, high-quality AV experiences.</p>
